      "instance_name": "ableist_trope_fake_disability_accusations",
      "label": "Fake Disability Accusations",
      "description": "A stereotype that implies people with disabilities are faking their condition to gain sympathy or advantages, which is used to undermine their legitimacy and the need for societal accommodation.",
